02:23.960 --> 02:24.800
Entah ke mana hilangnya!

02:35.240 --> 02:36.039
Helo, cik.

02:37.400 --> 02:38.080
Tak, tak, tak.

02:38.360 --> 02:39.599
Awak boleh cakap Cina?

02:40.240 --> 02:41.439
Tak, tak, tak.

02:41.439 --> 02:42.240
Helo.

02:42.800 --> 02:43.759
Tak, tak, tak.

02:43.919 --> 02:44.599
Presiden Gao.

02:45.000 --> 02:45.719
Cik ini...

02:45.719 --> 02:47.080
